{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>The Nethinim</b> — they are the chiefs of Gibeon and its daughters, and Joshua gave them to the house of his Elohim. Therefore they were called Nethinim, even though it is stated afterward, \"and of the Nethinim whom David and the officers gave for the service of the Levites\" — for the reason of the giving stands, or they were called Nethinim from that day, for previously they were called Gibeonites."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:39.591049999Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}